  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "奇巧ê Axolotl"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<h1><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Kî-khá ê <i>Axolotl</i></span></h1><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b><span><b>陳雷</b></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><br /></b></span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">（本文是漢羅合用kap全羅馬字一段一段對照）</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你kám bat聽過<i>Axolotl</i> chit个動物ê名？若是m̄ bat也無奇怪。因為伊teh-beh絕種，是上嚴重危機ê動物。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lí kám bat thiaⁿ-kòe <i>Axolotl</i> chit ê tōng-bu̍t ê miâ? Nā-sī m̄ bat iā bô kî-koài. In-ūi i teh-beh choa̍t-chéng, sī siōng giâm-tiōng gûi-ki ê tōng-bu̍t.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Axolotl</i> chit-má單單生tī墨西哥ê <i>Mexico</i>州、<i>Puebla</i>州kap <i>Michoacan</i>州。因為生態環境消失，汙染，全世界野生--ê可能賰無一、兩百隻。M̄-kú伊實在是一種真獨一、稀罕奇巧ê動物。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Axolotl</i> chit-má tan-tan seⁿ tī Be̍k-se-ko ê <i>Maxico</i> chiu, <i>Poebla</i> chiu kap <i>Michoacan</i> chiu. In-ūi seⁿ-thài khoân-kéng siau-sit, u-jiám, choân sè-kài iá-seng--ê khó-lêng chhun bô chi̍t, nn̄g-pah chiah. M̄-kú i si̍t-chāi sī 1 chióng chin to̍k-it, hi-hán kî-khá ê tōng-bu̍t.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kap水雞仝款屬tī兩棲動物。細隻水蛆期（larva）蹛tī水--裡。生做真kok-pih、古錐、大粒頭、細蕊目睭，有三對鰓生tī頭殼頂。親像頭殼發樹仔。遇著環境適當ê時，脫變成年（<i>adult</i>），頭鰓無--去，生跤peh起來陸地生湠。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kap chúi-ke kāng-khoán sio̍k tī lióng-chhe tōng-bu̍t. Sè-chiah chúi-chhu-kî (larva) tòa tī chúi--nih. Seⁿ-chò chin kok-pih, kó͘-chui, tōa-lia̍p-thâu, sè-lúi ba̍k-chiu, ū 3 tùi chhi seⁿ tī thâu-khak-téng. Chhin-chhiūⁿ thâu-khak hoat chhiū-á. Gū-tio̍h khoân-kéng sek-tong ê sî, thoat-piàn sêng-liân (<i>adult</i>), thâu-chhi bô--khì, seⁿ kha peh khí-lâi lio̍k-tē seⁿ-thòaⁿ.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊有幾項生物界真獨一奇巧ê特點：第一，伊ê器官有真強ê再生能力。跤、尾斷--去ē koh生新--ê，有時斷一肢生兩肢。甚至目睭、半个面、小部份ê腦mā ē koh生，回復功能。第二，伊bē生癌，到taⁿ iáu無發現生癌ê例。第三，伊ē接受別隻<i>Axolotl</i> ê器官移栽，bē排thiat。第四，伊ē-tàng永遠青春做水蛆，m̄免成年。另外心適ê所在，親像伊ê胚胎期大koh通光，真容易觀察研究，親像伊ê遺傳核酸鹹性單位（<i>nucleic acid base pair</i>）是人ê十倍種種。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">I ū kúi hāng seng-bu̍t-kài chin to̍k-it kî-khá ê te̍k-tiám: tē-1, i ê khì-koan ū chin kiông ê chài-seng lêng-le̍k. Kha, bóe tn̄g--khì ē koh seⁿ sin--ê. Ū-sî tn̄g 1 ki seⁿ 2 ki. Sīm-chì ba̍k-chiu, pòaⁿ ê bīn, sió-pō͘-hūn ê náu mā ē koh seⁿ, hôe-ho̍k kong-lêng. Tē-2, i bē seⁿ gâm, kàu-taⁿ iáu bô hoat-hiān seⁿ gâm ê lē. Tē-3, i ē chiap-siū pa̍t-chiah <i>Axolotl</i> ê khì-koan î-chai, bē pâi-thiat. Tē-4, i ē-tàng éng-oán chheng-chhun chò chúi-chhu, m̄-bián sêng-liân. Lēng-gōa sim-sek ê só͘-chāi, chhin-chhiūⁿ i ê phoe-thai-kî tōa koh thang-kng, chin iông-ī koan-chhat gián-kiù, chhin-chhiūⁿ i ê ûi-thoân hu̍t-sng kiâm-sèng tan-ūi (<i>nucleic acid base pair</i>) sī lâng ê 10 pōe chióng-chióng.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">因為chia-ê特徵牽涉著生物、醫學真根本ê問題，再生、免疫、生癌、器官移栽、老化。若是ē-tàng了解chia-ê代誌，人或者就ē-tàng永遠勇健青春。所以伊變做科學研究ê寶，實在是生物演化ê奇蹟。Chit个小小奇巧ê生物hō͘ lán教示，鼓舞lán來保護--伊，保護chit个地球ê環境。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">In-ūi chia-ê te̍k-teng khan-sia̍p-tio̍h seng-bu̍t, i-ha̍k chin kin-pún ê būn-tê, chài-seng, bián-e̍k, seⁿ gâm, khì-koan î-chai, ló-hòa. Nā-sī ē-tàng liáu-kái chia-ê tāi-chì, lâng he̍k-chiá tō ē-tàng éng-oán ióng-kiāⁿ chheng-chhun. Só͘-í i piàn-chò kho-ha̍k gián-kiù ê pó. Si̍t-chāi sī seng-bu̍t ián-hòa ê kî-chek. Chit ê sió-sió kî-khá ê seng-bu̍t hō͘ lán kà-sī, kó͘-bú lán lâi pó-hō͘--i, pó-hō͘ chit ê tē-kiû ê khoân-kéng.&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjkxlu9trf3LBIagqhrA-437rFINorQmyhKKVWROs5zuw1tQqrYHp5AnzQ4g9Z9OW0hrpIYIyASjyTFUdh0I3eOCoTovAp9HGg8Vh_T9M6JLxME7lfLnu1aS_ZwapumsxmdgmyNDMpb_SjBMgJhsjiobT8YUadZtgibZMcwcGvnaC1Ffhi-7A374plA9Q/s1424/346%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjkxlu9trf3LBIagqhrA-437rFINorQmyhKKVWROs5zuw1tQqrYHp5AnzQ4g9Z9OW0hrpIYIyASjyTFUdh0I3eOCoTovAp9HGg8Vh_T9M6JLxME7lfLnu1aS_ZwapumsxmdgmyNDMpb_SjBMgJhsjiobT8YUadZtgibZMcwcGvnaC1Ffhi-7A374plA9Q/w450-h640/346%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjPpWiUHMJvmW4e_zbf9YKfQdYdR_tvtlk-e-NXzt4J4ebArqJEsE5AfuXGP6hs6nrd3QQYfIw4KSnBmEOrjOJ2Nwgspsq6r3P6HRWviDegze144EuxsDuHUYJWOXgAxOffDi2eqoWg3MzuwaISdiQ6IBYthyViLOk2pVF_3AeN5_5MY4ZLPHf_wJXgTg/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1346%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8146.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjPpWiUH